### 先配置模型并执行 auth-requests.http 的登录，取得临时 token。
POST http://localhost:18081/api/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"conversationId":"http-chat-study","question":"解释一下当前项目的一次聊天调用链。"}

### 参数错误：预期 HTTP 400，code=QUESTION_REQUIRED，不调用模型。
POST http://localhost:18081/api/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"conversationId":"http-chat-study","question":"   "}

### 同一会话流式回答
POST http://localhost:18081/api/chat/stream
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream

{"conversationId":"http-chat-study","question":"再给一个具体例子。"}
$
